WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.253
(police radio chatter, sirens)

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:05.756
- Someone we know
got murdered last night.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.966
- You left the house in
the middle of the night?

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.718
Come on, what were you thinking?

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.304
- I'm a journalist!
- No, you're a fourth grader!

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.138
- A mark.

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:14.640
- Action.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:17.643
- There was something I really loved
about the idea of doing a show

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:19.228
that everybody could
watch together.

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:20.979
- You can never just let
anything go, can you?

00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:25.859
- I'm just saying that guy outside looked
like he wanted to M-U-R-D-E-R us.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:31.031
- The show is inspired by the real-life
Hilde, who made national news

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.283
for breaking stories
in her hometown.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:37.829
- It's this detective story,
where the detective duo

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:39.998
are an 8-year-old girl
and her father,

00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:41.458
who is an
investigative journalist.

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:44.503
- Something derails him,
and we don't know what it is,

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:47.548
and the whole family ended up
having to leave New York

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:50.968
and go to this tiny town
in Washington State.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:54.137
- Hilde starts investigating,
and unearths

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:55.597
a 31-year-old
cold case.

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:56.932
- No! No!

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.725
- Is that... Dad?

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.896
- The one thing I have
to bring to her is a strongness,

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.982
and she
won't back down.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.900
The public has the right to know

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:09.945
that Penny Gillis' death
is now under investigation.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:11.822
- How do I turn you off?

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:15.450
- There were places where I really
wanted be faithful to who Hilde was,

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:17.703
yet it's not based on
Hilde and her dad,

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.414
it's just inspired by these
beautiful things that they've done.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.292
- I want to be able to inspire kids
that they don't have to

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.377
just be in boxes
that adults put them in

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.212
because of their age
or gender

00:01:27.296 --> 00:01:28.672
or something
stupid like that.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.301
- That was like... yes!

00:01:32.384 --> 00:01:35.554
I know that you don't think that
you're a journalist anymore,

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:37.139
but I don't believe it.

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:41.018
- To see Hilde reporting on her own
after I stopped reporting,

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.812
to see her passion,
it made me love journalism again.

00:01:43.896 --> 00:01:46.064
- 'Cause if the truth
doesn't matter,

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:47.482
nothing ever will.

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:54.531
- What else I love about this show
is that it's really fun.

00:01:54.615 --> 00:01:58.076
- Putting together
the magical team that makes

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.871
the best version of something
is a gift.

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:04.249
Every day I'm on the set,
I can't believe it's real.

00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:06.126
- BOTH: I declare a thumb war.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.422
- I think this show
has the ability to inspire

00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:12.591
a whole new generation of kids.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:15.928
- It doesn't matter
what age you are,

00:02:16.011 --> 00:02:18.138
what you look like,
you can do anything.

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:20.349
- If I had
nothing to do with this show,

00:02:20.432 --> 00:02:22.267
I would want to see
what's going on next.

00:02:22.351 --> 00:02:23.685
- You sound like a commercial.

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:24.895
- Well, it's true.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.104
- I'm kidding, I'm kidding.

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:30.526
♪ I'll be your savior ♪

00:02:31.693 --> 00:02:34.029
♪ I'll be your savior ♪

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:34.988
[shouts]

00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:36.156
- Be smart.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.866
- I'd rather be brave.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.409
- Be both.

